1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,180
What if you paused time to skip an exam…

2
00:00:02,180 --> 00:00:04,020
and could never unpause it?

3
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:05,180
Sounds like a superpower.

4
00:00:05,480 --> 00:00:06,680
It's actually a trap.

5
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:07,960
First, it goes dark.

6
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:10,140
You see things because light hits your eyes.

7
00:00:10,140 --> 00:00:11,520
Paused light doesn't move.

8
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:12,820
So, instant blackout.

9
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:13,840
Then, silence.

10
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:15,500
Sound is air moving.

11
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:16,600
Paused air doesn't.

12
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:17,740
And here's the dark part.

13
00:00:17,860 --> 00:00:19,940
Every breath you take is moving air.

14
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:22,680
If the air is frozen, it's like breathing against a wall.

15
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:24,180
So you skipped your exam.

16
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:24,820
Congrats.

17
00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:28,040
You're also stuck in the dark, forever, holding your breath.

18
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:31,760
Know someone who says "I wish I could pause time" every Monday morning?

19
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:32,540
Send them this.

20
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:34,080
You might be saving their life.

21
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:37,500
And good news: this video is the last thing you'll ever see.

22
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:38,220
Make it count.

23
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:38,780
Subscribe.
